  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISSAT funding gap for  2nd phase of police coopera</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISSAT funding gap for  2nd phase of police coopera</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta st&#xf6;d ges f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla tillr&#xe4;cklig finansiering f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra ett uppdrag fr&#xe5;n Democratic Control of Armed Forces (DECAF) /International Security Sector Advisory Team (ISSAT) f&#xf6;r att, f&#xf6;r den svenska ambassadens r&#xe4;kning, f&#xf6;rbereda en andra fas av det svenskfinansierade n&#xe4;rpolisprogrammet i Albanien. 

ISSAT kommer att avdela expertis p&#xe5; h&#xf6;g kompetensniv&#xe5; f&#xf6;r att utveckla ett programdokument som kommer att anv&#xe4;ndas i anbudsf&#xf6;rfarandet f&#xf6;r den nya fasen av polisprojektet i Albanien. Den huvudsakliga kostnaden f&#xf6;r uppdraget t&#xe4;cks direkt av DECAF/ ISSAT som en tj&#xe4;nst f&#xf6;r Sverige som &#xe4;r en av organisationens (betalande) medlemmar. Bidraget kommer att anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r att t&#xe4;cka skillnaden i kostnader ut&#xf6;ver det &#xf6;vergripande DECAF/ISSAT st&#xf6;det till Sverige.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is provided to secure sufficient funding to a mission from Democratic Control of Armed Forces (DECAF) /International Secuirity Sector Advisory Team (ISSAT) to conduct a programme preparation mission in Albania on behalf of Sweden /Embassy as a second phase of the Swedish funded Community Policing programme.  ISSAT will deploy high level expertise to develop a programme document that will be used for tendering the new phase of police cooperation in Albania. The main cost for the programme development missions is covered directly by DECAF/ISSAT as a service to Sweden being a funding member. The contribution&apos;s funding will be used to cover the cost difference from the overall DECAF/ISSAT assistance provided to Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
